# EmailJS — get these from https://dashboard.emailjs.com/admin
# 1. Create a service (e.g. Gmail) and copy the Service ID.
# 2. Create an email template and copy the Template ID.
# 3. Copy your public key from Account > General.
#
# Your template must use these variables:
#   {{from_name}} {{from_email}} {{subject}} {{message}}
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
